# GenericAgent：仓库统一 LF（跨平台字节一致，避免行尾 churn / 幽灵 diff）。
# 仓库级规则优先于系统级 core.autocrlf=true；配套 .editorconfig。

# 默认：文本文件入库 + 检出统一 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# 脚本例外
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制：禁止任何转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
*.exe  binary
*.dll  binary
*.so   binary